    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">The Role of AI and Quantum Computing in Semiconductor Development</title>
      <p>Artificial Intelligence (AI) and quantum computing are expected to revolutionize the semiconductor industry. AI is already being leveraged to optimize the design and manufacturing processes of chips, while quantum computing holds the potential to solve problems that classical computers cannot address. These technologies are paving the way for faster, more powerful processors that will define the future of computing across all sectors.</p>
