    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Electric Aircraft and Sustainable Aviation</title>
      <p>Electric aircraft represent a significant shift toward sustainability in the aviation industry. These aircraft use battery-powered electric engines or hybrid propulsion systems, reducing their reliance on traditional jet fuel. This move aligns with global goals to reduce <i> italicized </i> carbon emissions and promote cleaner, more energy-efficient travel in the skies.</p>
