    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Autonomous Flight Systems</title>
      <p>Autonomous flight systems are poised <overline> This is a demo with overline </overline> to transform the aviation industry, reducing the need for human intervention in flight operations. These systems leverage AI, machine learning, and advanced sensors to automate tasks such as navigation, takeoff, and landing. As safety protocols improve, autonomous systems will offer the potential for more efficient and cost-effective flight operations.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Chip Technologies in Aerospace and Aviation</title>
      <p>In aerospace, advanced semiconductor technologies play a crucial role in enabling the development of cutting-edge flight systems, <b> give it more importance. </b> from autopilot to advanced navigation and communication tools. Chips are essential for the operation of everything from in-flight entertainment systems to satellite communications and onboard safety monitoring.</p>
    </section>
